msgstr "Rotate by campus bell; rotate the scissors too"

#. festivalIncidentPool.0.gate-claimants.responses.three-ribbons.label
#: src/data/festival.js:474
msgctxt "text:festivalIncidentPool.0.gate-claimants.responses.three-ribbons.label"
